    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Rob your friends or die&quot; is a game where you have to deceive your own friends in order to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends decided to climb into an old and abandoned building. Unfortunately, you disturbed the peace of an ancient spirit, who locked you in a small room. Now nothing and no one can help you. <u>You are here forever!</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of you will be allowed to leave this place. Who? This is what you will find out in the course of the game, in which <strong>your life is at stake!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are very simple</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a role that gives you a special active or passive ability, or an extra way to win the game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once at the table, blindly select one of the scrolls and do whatever it takes to keep the &quot;blank&quot; scroll, or whatever it takes to get rid of the &quot;cursed&quot; scroll.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.poster.avif?t=1751798331\" width=698 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.webm?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.mp4?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The round ends if the player steals the &quot;cursed&quot; scroll. For this, the player is sent to a room with 6 mirrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/46efa2859c18fa285f0d30a991be4e80.avif?t=1751798331\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must choose one of the mirrors. If the &quot;regular&quot; mirror was chosen, the player returns to his place and continues the game. <strong>If, after looking in the mirror, the player encounters a spirit, the game ends for him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.poster.avif?t=1751798331\" width=698 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.webm?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.mp4?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After selecting a mirror, the round starts over again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are the only survivor, you win and can leave this room.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Rob your friends or die&quot; is a game where you have to deceive your own friends in order to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends decided to climb into an old and abandoned building. Unfortunately, you disturbed the peace of an ancient spirit, who locked you in a small room. Now nothing and no one can help you. <u>You are here forever!</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of you will be allowed to leave this place. Who? This is what you will find out in the course of the game, in which <strong>your life is at stake!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules are very simple</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a role that gives you a special active or passive ability, or an extra way to win the game</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once at the table, blindly select one of the scrolls and do whatever it takes to keep the &quot;blank&quot; scroll, or whatever it takes to get rid of the &quot;cursed&quot; scroll.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.poster.avif?t=1751798331\" width=698 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.webm?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/de475e3c1603c0f20907c804ecddb331.mp4?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The round ends if the player steals the &quot;cursed&quot; scroll. For this, the player is sent to a room with 6 mirrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/46efa2859c18fa285f0d30a991be4e80.avif?t=1751798331\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must choose one of the mirrors. If the &quot;regular&quot; mirror was chosen, the player returns to his place and continues the game. <strong>If, after looking in the mirror, the player encounters a spirit, the game ends for him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.poster.avif?t=1751798331\" width=698 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.webm?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659550/extras/c2ee7f37d318c0b8e11d233a3a0eff1d.mp4?t=1751798331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After selecting a mirror, the round starts over again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are the only survivor, you win and can leave this room.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Rob your friends or die is a 4-player co-op game. Force your friends to take the &quot;cursed&quot; scroll, avoid the evil spirit and be the last one standing to win.",
